    narr:narration """This hub maintains the [foundational thesis of decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) as the primary product differentiator. The narrative trajectory, most recently updated in August 2026, focuses on [marshaling evidence](narr:Position_Sprint4SuccessEvidenceMarshaling) to validate this thesis through concrete delivery metrics. The team reports they have [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787650473508_1), which they identify as a [key unlock](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787650473508_3) enabled by the Zephyr integration. This technical milestone is presented alongside a [velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787650473508_2), which the team notes as their highest output for the quarter. The current framing links these operational successes directly to the core product value, positioning the recent integration as the catalyst for both increased efficiency and product capability.""" ;
